OL,3,GNEWSAProvider withdraws from digital
OL,4,Aweight loss trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new digital weight loss programme due
OL,7,Fto roll out this year will no longer go
OL,8,Fahead as planned.
OL,10,FThe weight management service had been
OL,11,Fdue to run as a two-year pilot to
OL,12,Fsupport adults living with obesity by
OL,13,Fprescribing medicines which help them
OL,14,Ffeel fuller.
OL,16,FPublic Health associate director Alex
OL,17,FHawkins-Drew said the programme had
OL,18,Fbeen "close to contract completion"
OL,19,Fwhen the chosen digital provider had
OL,20,Fdecided it could "no longer support
OL,21,Fthis provision".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
