OL,3,GNEWSAProvider withdraws from digital
OL,4,Aweight loss trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said she understood some people
OL,7,Fwould be disappointed but added her
OL,8,Fteam remained "committed to developing
OL,9,Fa service" and was now "re-evaluating
OL,10,Fwhat can be offered in the Bailiwick".
